{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 9, :comments ["And Elohim said: Let the waters be gathered — as I explained above by means of the רוח, for that is why it says: ״ורוח אלהים מרחפת״, like the splitting of the Sea of Reeds. Just as He divided the upper waters and separated them from the lower ones by an act of spreading, so the waters upon the earth He gathered by an act of רוח." "and let the dry land appear — that is: the ארץ that was created together with the upper heavens before the light was created, as I explained above — whether a long time or a short time."], :book :genesis, :voice :rashbam, :lang :en, :chapter 1, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T23:16:51.653518145Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}